  "summary": "Rejects the pending promise `p` with `reason` (0 if omitted). Rejection handlers attached with promise_then(3)/promise_catch(3) run from the microtask drain — never synchronously from this call, but still within the same gametick. An `await` suspended on `p` raises `reason` as an error at the await point (catchable with `acatch`).",
